0: fixture
    => t3 : [PVec [PVec [PVec Int]]] defined.
1: fixture
    => values : [PVec [PVec Int]] defined.
2: fixture
    => recs : [PVec {:k [PVec Int]}] defined.
3: recs:k*  (as parsed: (@bcast k) (@star flatten))
    => @[1 2 3] : [PVec Int]
4: t3 with (@bcast 0) (@star flatten)  — `t3:0*`, unspellable today
    => @[1 2 4] : [PVec Int]
5: t3:0  (the broadcast alone)
    => @[@[1 2] @[4]] : [PVec [PVec Int]]
6: t3:0{0 1}*  (known-length ravel of the broadcast's result)
    => @[1 2 4] : [PVec Int]
7: values with (@bcast (@id)) (@star flatten)  — the ε kind, not yet in the union
    => RAISED: select-step-kind: unknown select step kind: (@id)
